{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24663","headline":"昨日复今辰 · 白居易","name":"昨日复今辰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日复今辰，悠悠七十春。\n所经多故处，却想似前身。\n散秩优游老，闲居净洁贫。\n螺杯中有物，鹤氅上无尘。\n解佩收朝带，抽簪换野巾。\n风仪与名号，别是一生人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24663.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24663","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}